    "site_desc": "Site constructed on 5m wide roadway on a berm 0.5 m above water surface with commercial evaporating ponds to the NE and SW. no major constructions or vegetation within 350m radius of site installation. Significant channeling from terrain exists WEST 10 km, rising 600m above the site, causes local wind tunneling NE through SW flows. to the EAST is 8 km of commercial evaporation infrastructure and semi developed short brush agriculture. beyond the northern evaporative pond is open water Bear River drainage.",
